#: docs/index.rst:2
msgid "pymecheye"
msgstr "pymecheye"

#: docs/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Python bindings for Mech-Eye area-scan 3D cameras, built with nanobind and the Mech-"
"Eye C++ SDK. Installation compiles the native extension for the current CPython "
"version and threading ABI. NumPy is the only Python runtime dependency."
msgstr ""
"基于 nanobind 和 Mech-Eye C++ SDK 的 Mech-Eye 面阵 3D 相机 Python 绑定。安装时会针对当前 CPython 版本及线程 "
"ABI 编译原生扩展。NumPy 是唯一的 Python 运行时依赖。"

#: docs/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Install the distribution as ``pymecheye`` and import ``mecheye``. SDK capture and "
"parameter operations sit alongside camera lifecycle helpers, aligned NumPy capture, "
"and metadata dictionaries. The API reference is generated from the installed binding "
"and the Python docstrings."
msgstr ""
"安装分发包 ``pymecheye``，通过 ``mecheye`` 导入。SDK 采集与参数接口和相机生命周期管理、对齐的 NumPy "
"采集、元数据字典等便捷功能共同提供。API 参考从已安装的绑定及 Python 文档字符串自动生成。"

